---
title: Example · Checkout funnel
config:
  look: classic
  theme: dark
  themeCSS: |
    /* inline multiply blending hides links on a dark background */
    .link { mix-blend-mode: normal !important; }
  sankey:
    showValues: true
    nodeAlignment: justify
---
%% The sankey lexer accepts only printable ASCII, so node names stay English.
%% One `source,target,value` row per flow; outflows of a node should sum to its inflow. Quote a name that holds a comma; blank lines may separate stages.
%% `sankey.linkColor`: gradient (default) · source · target · a hex color such as `#a1a1a1`; `nodeAlignment`: justify · center · left · right; `labelStyle: outlined` draws labels outside the nodes with an outline; `nodeWidth` · `nodePadding` · `width` · `height` size it; `""` escapes a quote inside a quoted name.
%% Nodes take the dark theme's categorical palette and links blend source into target; `sankey.nodeColors` maps a node name to a hex color.
sankey
Visit,Product page,1000
Product page,Cart,420
Product page,Left site,580

Cart,Checkout,300
Cart,Abandoned cart,120

Checkout,Paid,270
Checkout,Payment failed,30
